Minimal patch to pristine PIDSMaker 2289cd9 for HABITUS (optc_h501 database name only).

Upstream names the optc_h501 database 'optc_501'; the dump restore (scripts/load_dumps.sh) names each
database after its dump file, so the optc_h501 dump lands in 'optc_h501'. habitus.data.upstream and
scripts/build_graphs.py also set cfg.dataset.database programmatically, so the patch is needed only
when upstream PIDSMaker is run on its own. Apply from the PIDSMaker checkout: git apply upstream.patch

diff --git a/pidsmaker/config/config.py b/pidsmaker/config/config.py
--- a/pidsmaker/config/config.py
+++ b/pidsmaker/config/config.py
@@ -214,8 +214,8 @@
     },
     "optc_h501": {
         "raw_dir": "",
-        "database": "optc_501",
-        "database_all_file": "optc_501",
+        "database": "optc_h501",
+        "database_all_file": "optc_h501",
         "num_node_types": 3,
         "num_edge_types": 10,
         "start_date": "2019-09-15",
